WEBVTT

00:03.000 --> 00:04.170
You got this!

00:03.420 --> 00:04.170
Go!

00:04.170 --> 00:05.330
C'mon!

00:05.330 --> 00:06.130
Get him!

00:19.460 --> 00:20.420
Match over!

00:25.460 --> 00:27.290
He did so well, Big Sister!

00:28.170 --> 00:28.920
Yes!

00:30.170 --> 00:32.960
You're really knocking out the competition there, Arthur!

00:33.210 --> 00:34.460
Thank you!

00:35.170 --> 00:36.040
Congrats.

00:36.380 --> 00:40.960
I'm jealous you'll get to see
Princess Pride more often from here on.

00:40.960 --> 00:45.210
Don't say that, Eric! You'll get even more jealous.

00:45.460 --> 00:46.790
That's true.

00:48.170 --> 00:51.580
Everyone that took part in the selection thinks the same.

00:56.080 --> 01:00.420
Do us proud, Imperial Guardsman Arthur Bersford.

01:01.170 --> 01:01.750
I will!

01:20.080 --> 01:23.710
I'm happy that Arthur's been around a lot ever since then.

01:24.080 --> 01:24.880
So am I!

01:25.330 --> 01:28.210
You'll come with us to the next observation, won't you?

01:28.670 --> 01:30.290
Yeah, of cour-

01:29.630 --> 01:30.710
Of course he will.

01:31.210 --> 01:33.580
In case there's an emergency concerning Elder Sister,

01:33.580 --> 01:37.210
who is the first in line for the throne,
he'll always be with her as a guard.

01:37.750 --> 01:40.040
That's the role of an Imperial guardsman, right?

01:40.420 --> 01:41.080
Yeah.

01:42.000 --> 01:45.000
But even so, that day was amazing.

01:45.330 --> 01:47.170
You mean about the selection day activities?

01:47.290 --> 01:52.880
Yes! All the knights aside from the captain
and vice-captain volunteered, right?

01:53.420 --> 01:58.170
Thanks to that, it grew to a large-scale event
that spanned two days, though.

01:59.580 --> 02:02.040
Maybe they liked the sound of the "Imperial Guard",

02:02.330 --> 02:08.290
or the prize that could be won was appealing, or
perhaps it was the honor of protecting the royal family...

02:09.330 --> 02:13.000
All of the participating knights had tremendous
fighting spirit and a go-for-it attitude.

02:15.000 --> 02:19.210
Perhaps I should reconsider
the knight's wages and salary...

02:25.330 --> 02:26.290
What was that?!

02:26.580 --> 02:29.420
There's a man collapsed on the street blocking our path!

02:30.080 --> 02:31.460
We'll move him out of the way immediately!

02:43.330 --> 02:44.040
Pride!

02:44.040 --> 02:44.790
Princess Pride!

02:49.500 --> 02:50.330
Val?!

04:22.500 --> 04:25.460
<b>"The Cruel Princess and the Criminal"</b>

04:29.920 --> 04:30.920
Where am I?

04:34.460 --> 04:39.000
I found you collapsed on the street,
and you were carried to the castle.

04:39.790 --> 04:40.670
You little...

04:42.250 --> 04:44.670
Y-you're...

04:53.130 --> 04:56.670
Calm down, Val. Listen to me right now.

04:58.750 --> 05:03.670
It's okay. He's signed a fealty contract with Elder Sister.

05:04.580 --> 05:07.580
He has no choice but to obey what
Elder Sister, his master, says.

05:08.000 --> 05:13.500
And he can't harm others, nor can
he lay a single finger on the royal family.

05:14.500 --> 05:19.330
Answer me, Val. Why were you passed out there?

05:21.750 --> 05:28.500
As you have ordered, Your Highness,
and as stated in the fealty contract...

05:28.790 --> 05:30.500
I have come back!

05:35.540 --> 05:42.380
If you are ever faced with an impossible situation,
and you wish from your heart for someone to help you,

05:42.920 --> 05:44.460
come back to me.

05:47.960 --> 05:52.960
I will forgive your disrespect towards us
on the condition that we will come to no harm.

05:57.580 --> 05:59.750
You'd like me to do something, right?

06:00.710 --> 06:05.290
No! I was only drawn to you
because of that fealty contract!

06:05.710 --> 06:07.460
I don't want your help.

06:07.460 --> 06:11.670
You want someone's help, even if not mine, right?

06:15.710 --> 06:16.580
Yeah.

06:18.130 --> 06:19.540
Well then, go ahead and ask.

06:19.710 --> 06:20.540
Stop!

06:22.830 --> 06:26.250
If I ask, he must answer.

06:26.960 --> 06:29.330
But, even so, if it's that much of a predicament

06:29.330 --> 06:34.790
that he'd ask me for something though
he never came to me even once up to now...

06:35.330 --> 06:37.250
I must ask about it.

06:38.290 --> 06:41.750
Val, please tell me what you'd like sincerely.

06:47.040 --> 06:48.380
Remove your hands.

06:52.670 --> 06:58.380
He...lp me... help... me...

07:01.040 --> 07:06.630
As your master, I command you.
Speak clearly of what you want!

07:07.170 --> 07:10.250
The kids! Help them!

07:15.580 --> 07:17.500
And who are these kids?

07:18.000 --> 07:22.170
Two lower-class kids named Kemet and Sefec.

07:22.920 --> 07:25.710
They were taken by some human traffickers.

07:26.420 --> 07:27.750
And what's the plan to save them?

07:27.960 --> 07:32.290
Exchange them for five others by sundown tomorrow.

07:33.210 --> 07:39.420
Well, besides the fact that I can't actually do it,
I have doubts those guys would really trade hostages.

07:40.330 --> 07:47.710
I told you all I needed to, Princess. Your business
with me is done, now hurry and release me.

07:48.210 --> 07:52.960
His means were taken away by the fealty contract,
and there's nothing he can do.

07:54.040 --> 07:55.210
That's precisely why...

07:56.420 --> 07:59.580
Val, starting tonight you are placed under house arrest.

07:59.580 --> 08:00.250
What?!

08:00.670 --> 08:01.880
What are you trying to do?!

08:02.210 --> 08:04.380
Is this also a part of my punishment, you...

08:04.920 --> 08:06.710
you monster?!

08:09.540 --> 08:10.920
Stale, Arthur.

08:14.960 --> 08:17.420
We will do as you desire, First Princess Pride.

08:22.170 --> 08:23.460
I will help them.

08:25.580 --> 08:29.540
Human trafficking is a prohibited violation
of the laws of our country,

08:30.000 --> 08:33.380
and I cannot turn a blind eye to
a fiend that kidnaps children.

08:34.000 --> 08:39.210
Above all else, I have an obligation to grasp
the hand of a man who is seeking help from me.

08:41.670 --> 08:46.790
I will take back my countryfolk,
and the people precious to you!

08:54.250 --> 08:59.040
This time, Gilbert will also take part
in this hostage recovery operation.

08:59.790 --> 09:03.380
He has information on human trafficking.

09:04.130 --> 09:07.080
Right, that's quite encouraging. Thank goodness.

09:07.960 --> 09:09.420
It's strangely quiet...

09:10.250 --> 09:11.330
Careful out there.

09:16.330 --> 09:17.380
This is awful.

09:18.080 --> 09:20.710
I made the bleakness a little better.

09:22.250 --> 09:26.500
You said I could go free, yeah, Princess?

09:28.630 --> 09:31.250
I have also commanded that you do not use violence.

09:32.710 --> 09:33.580
Thanks.

09:34.130 --> 09:35.000
It's fine.

09:37.130 --> 09:38.040
Here's your meal.

09:38.830 --> 09:42.500
I will not tolerate you dumping it
out or wasting it otherwise.

09:54.750 --> 09:55.630
It's all right.

09:57.880 --> 10:01.460
Sorry 'bout that, I saw a bug.

10:05.330 --> 10:06.630
Nice skill.

10:08.420 --> 10:12.540
It's a precious, useless possession
after your contract though, Princess.

10:13.210 --> 10:16.080
Wanna see what I can do with a fork?

10:17.040 --> 10:18.000
Hey, criminal.

10:18.540 --> 10:23.750
Don't forget that as royalty,
both Tiara and I have the right to give you orders.

10:25.080 --> 10:27.170
Even if I was trying to get on your bad side,
there'd be no point.

10:27.540 --> 10:30.670
You won't be able to get out of here until tomorrow.

10:31.670 --> 10:35.080
After you have your meal, you'll go to bed.

10:35.580 --> 10:39.330
To save the children, you need
to be in perfect physical condi-

10:40.080 --> 10:43.130
I told you! I don't need your help!

10:44.540 --> 10:50.630
Um, you're... trying to help Kemet and Sefec, aren't you?

10:51.670 --> 10:56.380
Yeah. But I'm not asking for help from all of you.

10:57.670 --> 11:00.330
Aren't those kids important to you?

11:01.000 --> 11:04.710
What?! Those little brats aren't important to me at all!

11:05.000 --> 11:05.710
Huh?

11:06.000 --> 11:08.460
So... you aren't worried?

11:08.880 --> 11:12.670
No, I'm not! Stop saying random things that could apply!

11:13.040 --> 11:16.080
Then... why do you want to help them?

11:17.580 --> 11:18.880
Because I need it!

11:19.540 --> 11:24.080
So I can live comfortably! That's why!

11:30.920 --> 11:33.330
To... live comfortably?

11:36.750 --> 11:38.580
To live comfortably?

11:39.750 --> 11:48.960
He can't mean... that he uses those children to do his
labor for him since he's restricted by the fealty contract...

11:50.290 --> 11:56.540
No... What are Kemet and Sefec to you?

11:57.460 --> 11:59.830
Some brats I'm so sick of I could die!

12:00.330 --> 12:02.500
Just remembering them makes me feel sick.

12:05.290 --> 12:08.500
If you're satisfied, get lost, Princess.

12:09.290 --> 12:13.830
Spoiled brats that live in a privileged society
like you lot make me want to vomit.

12:18.040 --> 12:21.250
Tiara, I'm sorry that scared you.

12:22.460 --> 12:23.750
Big Sister...

12:25.750 --> 12:28.420
She's sensitive to people's sorrows.

12:29.080 --> 12:33.500
I'm positive there must be
a reason why Tiara spoke to Val.

12:34.290 --> 12:36.420
Moreover, what Val said earlier...

12:39.500 --> 12:42.540
Stale, Arthur. Please take care of Tiara.

12:42.540 --> 12:44.540
I'm going to stay here a little longer.

12:44.540 --> 12:45.170
What?!

12:46.540 --> 12:47.960
What are you saying?!

12:48.210 --> 12:49.960
Leave you alone with a guy like that?!

12:50.580 --> 12:55.920
It will be fine. I'm Val's master, so please do this.

12:57.670 --> 12:59.960
I'm coming for you in one hour.

13:02.040 --> 13:02.830
Big Sister...

13:03.630 --> 13:05.920
I'm sorry I couldn't do anything.

13:07.040 --> 13:08.500
That isn't true at all.

13:17.290 --> 13:21.920
This must be a good show for
pretty little princesses like you, eh?

13:23.960 --> 13:28.670
How much are you gonna toy with my life
before you're satisfied, you stupid child?

13:29.040 --> 13:30.380
Just for tonight.

13:30.920 --> 13:35.460
When the morning comes, you and I
are going to go save Kemet and Sefec.

13:35.460 --> 13:37.580
I'm not looking for your help!

13:39.130 --> 13:43.880
Answer me. Why are you going
so far to prevent us from helping?

13:43.880 --> 13:47.000
You're the ones who put me in this position.

13:47.630 --> 13:54.420
Answer me. Are you saying that you want
to refuse my help due to your shame?

13:54.710 --> 13:55.630
Exactly.

13:56.040 --> 14:01.580
Answer me. Well then, about Kemet and Sefec,
who you want to save.

14:02.000 --> 14:05.710
Does your shame take priority over them?

14:06.540 --> 14:07.080
Ye-

14:11.710 --> 14:12.580
No.

14:14.920 --> 14:20.290
Tell me. How did you meet Kemet and Sefec?

14:21.500 --> 14:25.630
Those kids were living in
my old place without permission.

14:26.580 --> 14:30.380
From then on, Sefec brought Kemet along
and followed me all over.

14:30.710 --> 14:32.790
Why did you live with them?

14:33.170 --> 14:36.920
I told you, those brats just came
and chose to follow me around!

14:37.500 --> 14:41.250
Even when I changed homes, they'd come
and freakin' find me, over and over again!

14:41.710 --> 14:45.250
It's thanks to your annoying contract
that I can't lay a single finger on 'em.

14:46.540 --> 14:48.790
Do you know why they followed you around?

14:49.250 --> 14:53.830
They think just having someone like me
next to them will keep them safe!

14:54.170 --> 14:55.790
They're some damn irritating kids!

14:59.040 --> 15:06.960
As far as what he's said, it really sounds like he was
annoyed by being followed around by those kids...

15:07.830 --> 15:09.710
If that's true, then why-

15:10.380 --> 15:12.000
Because I need it!

15:12.460 --> 15:16.830
So I can live comfortably! That's why!

15:19.920 --> 15:22.500
What are Kemet and Sefec like?

15:27.630 --> 15:31.540
They're both special ability users, but... they're just kids.

15:32.250 --> 15:34.960
Kemet is totally competent when it comes to words,

15:35.420 --> 15:38.080
but that kid's barely got any purpose of his own.

15:39.080 --> 15:42.420
He's always following behind me or Sefec every day...

15:43.380 --> 15:46.920
and not even I know what that kid's special ability is.

15:48.170 --> 15:52.420
Sefec also made sure to bring
Kemet everywhere she goes.

15:53.210 --> 15:58.500
Even though they aren't related by blood,
she takes care of Kemet because she's the big sister.

15:59.830 --> 16:06.080
She's sassy and if anything happens, she'll immediately
use her ability and knock 'em out with water at full blast.

16:06.500 --> 16:10.080
Sefec was also the one who
first thought to follow me around.

16:10.960 --> 16:13.460
She tosses and turns while sleeping
even more than Kemet does,

16:13.460 --> 16:15.830
so she steals the blankets every freakin' time.

16:16.080 --> 16:20.040
Neither of them even knew money existed
until I taught them about it.

16:21.000 --> 16:22.580
When we eat...

16:25.000 --> 16:29.170
Gah, dammit! I'm starting to feel sick again!

16:31.960 --> 16:33.420
Are you happy now?!

16:34.540 --> 16:37.210
Something feels wrong...

16:38.420 --> 16:41.250
Are you truly not worried about them?

16:41.580 --> 16:42.920
I already told you!

16:43.460 --> 16:46.380
What is worrying to you?

16:48.330 --> 16:49.420
What do you mean by that?

16:50.000 --> 16:54.130
What are the things that have been
precious to you up until now?

16:54.960 --> 16:59.000
Money and your life. What is there besides that?

17:00.000 --> 17:01.080
Unbelievable...

17:02.040 --> 17:04.710
Has that been all this whole time?

17:05.920 --> 17:11.460
What about family and friends... and how about
your comrades that died when that cliff collapsed?

17:11.880 --> 17:16.710
I don't care about those parents
that abandoned me. No friends either.

17:17.080 --> 17:21.960
Those guys that died in the cliff collapse were
just the most convenient group for me at the time.

17:22.630 --> 17:24.630
I don't give a crap that they died.

17:26.250 --> 17:28.250
Then how about Kemet and Sefec?

17:31.830 --> 17:35.040
What would you think if the two of them died?

17:39.460 --> 17:40.290
I'd hate it.

17:41.420 --> 17:43.500
Val! That's important!

17:43.500 --> 17:44.250
Stop it!

17:45.290 --> 17:48.210
You're wrong! Wrong, wrong, wrong!

17:48.630 --> 17:51.040
Those stupid brats aren't anything special to me!

17:51.630 --> 17:57.170
That's enough... to make me feel disgusting!

17:58.540 --> 18:02.710
This hasn't happened before!
This thing that feels like heartburn!

18:03.710 --> 18:10.420
And my heart has never pounded so hard
that I feel nauseous... never!

18:12.420 --> 18:13.250
Why?

18:13.750 --> 18:18.420
Why? Just thinking about what's happening
to them makes me nauseous,

18:18.420 --> 18:22.130
and I can't help but want to hit something!

18:23.670 --> 18:26.330
Their last words! Their screams!

18:26.920 --> 18:31.750
I can't stop hearing them and they won't go away!

18:32.880 --> 18:36.130
This has never happened to me before!

18:41.960 --> 18:43.630
It's your fault!

18:43.880 --> 18:50.670
If you had just executed me back then without asking
my opinion it wouldn't have turned out like this!

18:51.170 --> 18:53.630
Back then, if you had just killed me...

18:54.040 --> 18:56.790
I wouldn't know this pain or anything like this!

18:57.380 --> 19:02.080
I don't want to be this sort of person!

19:10.380 --> 19:11.130
What...

19:14.630 --> 19:17.920
I've never seen such awkward tears before.

19:19.000 --> 19:20.750
I'm sure he hasn't realized it.

19:21.670 --> 19:30.790
The reason he's crying, what Kemet and Sefec
are to him, and maybe even why it hurts so much.

19:32.080 --> 19:37.130
No, it's not that he hasn't realized it.
He just doesn't know.

19:43.290 --> 19:44.420
Don't push me away.

19:48.420 --> 19:49.290
I will answer.

19:49.880 --> 19:55.330
Why are you suffering? Because that is your punishment.

19:56.460 --> 20:01.670
Though you've injured, hurt,
and taken so many people's lives...

20:02.330 --> 20:06.250
you couldn't comprehend the suffering
and pain of those people.

20:07.540 --> 20:14.580
All that you've done up to now you will surely
continue to feel from now on, until forever.

20:15.750 --> 20:17.000
I will answer.

20:17.540 --> 20:21.170
Why is it that what you understand
as "precious" is wrong?

20:21.580 --> 20:28.460
It's because you didn't have anything that was way
more precious to you than your own life or money.

20:29.420 --> 20:30.750
I will answer.

20:31.330 --> 20:37.210
The true nature of that disgusting feeling,
like your insides are crawling around.

20:38.920 --> 20:40.830
That is called "worry."

20:45.750 --> 20:53.330
Why didn't I notice this sooner? I'm sure Tiara did.

20:54.540 --> 20:57.630
Princess Pride... Do you need something?

20:57.790 --> 20:58.920
Those eyes...

20:59.750 --> 21:02.290
Why can't anyone help my father?!

21:03.290 --> 21:09.380
and those tears too. Even though
I knew it a long time ago...

21:13.170 --> 21:14.330
I will answer.

21:15.000 --> 21:20.710
Those tears of yours, are tears from
when thinking about family!

21:33.080 --> 21:38.580
Because I need it! So, I can live comfortably! That's why!

21:39.210 --> 21:50.420
When the two of them aren't there, your body must
struggle so much that you can no longer feel happiness!

21:52.540 --> 21:54.540
You're thinking about those two!

23:28.170 --> 23:33.790
The Most Heretical Last Boss Queen:
From Villainess to Savior.

23:34.580 --> 23:38.380
Episode 10: "The Coldhearted Princess Sneaks In."

23:35.330 --> 23:41.000
<b>"The Coldhearted Princess Sneaks In"</b>
